# Print-specific overrides. Build.ps1 merges these on top of content.env.
PAGE_TITLE=Georgios Feidakis CV
CV_FILENAME=https://geofeid.github.io/OnlineCV/
CV_DOWNLOAD_NAME=Georgios_Feidakis_Online_CV
CV_LABEL=Online CV

ABOUT_PARAGRAPH=Passionate Software Engineer with expertise in Angular, TypeScript, React / Next JS and modern front-end tools like Tailwind, Prime NG, Material, Bootstrap, and responsive design. Experienced in building scalable web apps, integrating RESTful APIs, and contributing to full-stack projects with C#, Node.js, and SQL. Familiar with DevOps pipelines using Azure, Jenkins and Docker. Committed to clean code, continuous learning, and collaborative development.

EXP1_DESC=Refactored a legacy ASPX-based banking system into a modern Angular UI, improving maintainability, usability, and frontend structure. Led development and maintenance of an Angular-based insurance sales platform, supporting secure operations, deployments, and production stability. Collaborated with stakeholders and backend teams to capture requirements, align implementation details, and ensure seamless system integration. Conducted code reviews, enforced frontend best practices, maintained code quality, and mentored junior developers.

EXP2_DESC=Developed scalable Angular applications across travel authorization, ticketing, eCommerce, government, ERP, and fuel management platforms. Built reusable frontend solutions using custom Angular components, templated flows, integrated APIs, and dynamic user interactions. Led the EuroElections 2024 upgrade from Angular 7 to Angular 18 using Angular Signals, improving performance and maintainability. Refactored ERP and fuel station systems using NgRx, responsive design, Jenkins, Docker, and CI/CD practices.

EXP3_DESC=Contributed to the redesign and modernization of a large-scale eBanking platform, migrating legacy AngularJS functionality to the latest Angular ecosystem. Implemented complex banking workflows across payments, transfers, approvals, validations, and multi-step transactional journeys. Translated Figma designs into responsive, clean Angular interfaces, supporting rebranding, design consistency, and seamless user experience across devices. Worked on .NET BFF integrations, unit testing, Azure DevOps pipelines, releases, debugging, refactoring, and maintainable enterprise delivery.

